-- Digital gifts, Phase A: the universe, collection, occasion tags and rarity of the catalog rows seeded before it
-- (13 items, 16 products), as listed in src/lib/gifts-data.ts (gifts-data.test.ts checks the two agree). Updates by
-- slug / sku only: re-running writes the same values again; nothing is inserted, deleted or dropped.

